 Google Analytics is used for traffic tracking, while Google Ads is used for advertising campaigns.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535045320\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535045320\",\"name\":\"Digital Marketing vs Data Analytics: Which is easier to learn?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Digital marketing is generally easier to start because it focuses on creativity and platform management. Data analytics requires technical skills and statistical understanding, which may take more time to learn.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535059567\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535059567\",\"name\":\"Which is better: Digital Marketing or Data Analytics?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It depends on your interest. If you like creativity and marketing, choose digital marketing. If you enjoy numbers and data, data analytics is better for you.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535082341\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-vs-data-analytics\/#faq-question-1772535082341\",\"name\":\"Is coding required for Digital Marketing?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, coding is not required. Basic knowledge of <a href=\\\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">H